# Shaped like a repository a cloud session actually clones: a runtime directive plus an
# optional one, and deliberately never `direnv allow`ed - the whitelist in direnv.toml is
# what has to make it load. The committed .claude/settings.json beside it is what a
# repository consuming this actually ships, and what use_claude_env must leave alone.
#
# The pinned pixi version is the one cloud/scripts/02-install-pixi.sh pre-seeds. A cloud
# session cannot reach pixi.sh, so a fixture pinning anything else would have no way to
# install it - keep the two in step.
use pixi 0.81.0 python
use sonarqube_mcp
use claude_env
